+# shader
+
+## add Functional
+
+- [Branch-selected image stores](../../../core/shader/recompiler/Optimization/src/ResourceTracker.cpp) (shader recompiler) - an `image_store` whose T# is a Phi of descriptors (each branch of a uniform or divergent branch loads its own) is split as reads are: one store per T#, each made only by the lanes whose branch picked that T#. Atomics through such a T# are still refused (`is not a valid runtime value`). Synthetic programs only; not measured on hardware.
